Subject: [PATCH 4.19 138/267] net: lpc-enet: fix error return code in lpc_mii_init()
Date:   Fri, 19 Jun 2020 16:32:03 +0200
Message-Id: <20200619141655.448321027@linuxfoundation.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.27.0
